WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:05.010
Ask some Hindu teachers to describe
the ultimate reality behind everything,

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.490
and you may hear a strange answer.

3
00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.570
Not this.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.920
Not this.

5
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:13.380
Whatever words you try,
it is beyond them all.

6
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:18.150
Can something be ultimately real without
being someone who made the world?

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.600
So can a religion have
no creator God at all,

8
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.890
and if so, what is ultimately real?

9
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.880
In this mission, you'll explore Brahman,
the ultimate reality of Hindu teaching,

10
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.040
with and without qualities.

11
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:37.360
Then you'll weigh a bold claim: does
religion need a personal God at all?

12
00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:41.950
Your mission: find out what different
traditions say is ultimately real.
